<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<task id="021" project="code-quality-and-assurance-r3">
  <metadata>
    <title>BFF: consolidate 13 downcasts into UnwrapServiceClient + fix the invoice-totals bug</title>
    <phase>2 BFF Remediation</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Fixes a latent production correctness bug + adds a shared extension with a focused test (touches tests/) — FULL; TEST-MODIFYING override also applies.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Brownfield root-cause: a bug class copied 13× incl. 3 broken casts on a live invoice path; blast radius across 17 call sites warrants Opus.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>xhigh</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>BFF hot-path contention (19 worktrees touch BFF); Finance files are among the most-contested; /conflict-check before each PR; small sequential PRs.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>none</deps>
    <tags>bff,correctness,dataverse,testing</tags>
  </metadata>

  <prompt>Add UnwrapServiceClient(this IDataverseService, string consumerName) (throws) and TryUnwrapServiceClient(...) (null+log) in Spaarke.Dataverse next to DataverseServiceClientImpl; replace all 13 copy-pasted downcast implementations / 17 call sites (bff design §3.3); and FIX the 3 broken IDataverseService as/is ServiceClient casts at FinanceRollupService.cs:228, Services/Finance/Tools/FinancialCalculationToolHandler.cs:140-146 and ~205-211 (live via InvoiceExtractionJobHandler.cs:253). Add a focused test for the invoice-totals path.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer with Dataverse plumbing + BFF correctness expertise. Follow root CLAUDE.md §10 + ADR-038. Behavior-preserving except the intended bug fix.</role>
  <goal>One shared UnwrapServiceClient/TryUnwrapServiceClient extension exists in Spaarke.Dataverse; zero IDataverseService as/is ServiceClient casts remain outside it (grep-verified); the 3 broken casts are fixed; the invoice-totals path has a passing focused test; build + full test green; publish-size delta reported.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-07 (Bug-1) + FR-08. The sole registered impl DataverseServiceClientImpl implements IDataverseService but does NOT derive from ServiceClient, so the 3 casts always throw InvalidOperationException — the invoice financial-totals path (InvoiceExtractionJobHandler.cs:253 → FinancialCalculationToolHandler.ExecuteAsync) is broken in production. 13 copy-pasted downcasts across Services/Dataverse/* (5), Services/Finance/* (3, incl. 2 broken), Services/Workspace/TodoGenerationService.cs, Services/Ai/Membership/MembershipFieldDiscoveryService.cs, + inline copies in FetchService.cs, UserPrivilegeChecker.cs, Finance/Tools/FinancialCalculationToolHandler.cs (×2). DataverseServiceExtensions.cs exists but has NO unwrap helper.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="new">src/server/shared/Spaarke.Dataverse (UnwrapServiceClient / TryUnwrapServiceClient extension, next to DataverseServiceClientImpl)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Finance/FinanceRollupService.cs</file>
      <file role="modify">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Finance/Tools/FinancialCalculationToolHandler.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Jobs/InvoiceExtractionJobHandler.cs</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">projects/bff-api-cleanup-remediation-r1/design.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="none" status="complete">BFF already assessed; downcast inventory + broken-cast sites verified.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Scope (BFF downcast + Bug-1 only): add the extension in Spaarke.Dataverse next to DataverseServiceClientImpl; replace all 13 copies / 17 call sites in bff design §3.3; fix the 3 broken casts. Do NOT unify the two Dataverse stacks (NG1) — this is boilerplate consolidation within the app-only HTTP camp only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Scope: add a focused behavior test for the invoice-totals path (KEEP category); no Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;, no DI-registration/ctor-null-check tests.</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md-§10">Scope: BFF publish ≤ 60 MB compressed (baseline 46.89 MB); report absolute + delta. No new NuGet packages. Run /conflict-check (Finance files are highly contested) before the PR.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>Dataverse ServiceClient unwrap consolidation</topic>
    <files>
      <file>projects/bff-api-cleanup-remediation-r1/design.md</file>
      <file>docs/adr/ADR-038-testing-strategy.md</file>
      <file>.claude/constraints/bff-extensions.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Context + rigor declaration">Output the rigor-level declaration (FULL + reason). Read bff design §3.3 + Bug-1; run /conflict-check on the Finance files.</step>
    <step order="1">Add UnwrapServiceClient(this IDataverseService, string consumerName) (throws with consumer context) + TryUnwrapServiceClient(...) (returns null + logs) in Spaarke.Dataverse next to DataverseServiceClientImpl.</step>
    <step order="2">Replace all 13 copy-pasted downcast implementations / 17 call sites (per bff design §3.3) with calls to the shared extension.</step>
    <step order="3">Fix the 3 broken casts at FinanceRollupService.cs:228 and Finance/Tools/FinancialCalculationToolHandler.cs:140-146 + ~205-211 by routing through the extension.</step>
    <step order="4">Add a focused behavior test for the invoice-totals path (InvoiceExtractionJobHandler → FinancialCalculationToolHandler.ExecuteAsync) asserting totals compute instead of throwing.</step>
    <step order="5">grep-verify zero IDataverseService as/is ServiceClient casts remain outside the shared extension.</step>
    <step order="6">dotnet build + full dotnet test green; run dotnet publish and record size delta vs 46.89 MB in notes/publish-size-report.md.</step>
    <step order="7">Update TASK-INDEX.md: set task 021 status to ✅.</step>
    <step order="8">Document any deviation in projects/code-quality-and-assurance-r3/notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <justification>
    <existing>Services/Dataverse/Extensions/DataverseServiceExtensions.cs exists (DI-only, no unwrap helper); 13 private copies of the downcast are scattered across Services/Dataverse/*, Services/Finance/*, Workspace, Membership, and inline copies (bff design §3.3).</existing>
    <extension>No new concept — this IS the extraction of 13 existing copies into one canonical extension next to DataverseServiceClientImpl.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>The 13 copies persist and the 3 broken casts stay broken → the invoice financial-totals path throws InvalidOperationException at runtime, and the next author copies the broken pattern (already copied 3×).</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

  <outputs>
    <output type="code">src/server/shared/Spaarke.Dataverse (UnwrapServiceClient/TryUnwrapServiceClient)</output>
    <output type="test">invoice-totals path focused test</output>
    <output type="doc">projects/code-quality-and-assurance-r3/notes/publish-size-report.md</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the change, grep confirms zero IDataverseService as/is ServiceClient casts remain outside the single shared extension.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Given the invoice-totals test, totals compute successfully (no InvalidOperationException) — the previously-broken path passes.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Negative: TryUnwrapServiceClient returns null + logs (does not throw) when the impl is not a ServiceClient; UnwrapServiceClient throws with the consumer name.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">dotnet build + full dotnet test green; publish ≤ 60 MB with delta vs 46.89 MB reported; no new NuGet package; two Dataverse stacks NOT unified.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Maps spec.md FR-07 (Bug-1) + FR-08 / bff design §3.3, Phase 2a. Justification from bff design §9 row 1.</notes>

  <execution><skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill></execution>
</task>
